---
title: "propose (Compound V2: Governor Bravo)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_threshold_check: votes = comp.getPriorVotes(msg.sender, block.number - 1)
    q_threshold_check --> q_below: votes <= proposalThreshold
    q_below --> [*]: revert "proposer votes below proposal threshold"
    q_threshold_check --> q_pending_check: votes > proposalThreshold
    q_pending_check --> q_has_pending: proposer has pending or active proposal
    q_has_pending --> [*]: revert "one live proposal per proposer"
    q_pending_check --> q_validate_actions: no pending/active proposal
    q_validate_actions --> q_no_actions: targets.length == 0
    q_no_actions --> [*]: revert "must provide actions"
    q_validate_actions --> q_too_many: targets.length > proposalMaxOperations
    q_too_many --> [*]: revert "too many actions"
    q_validate_actions --> q_mismatch: array lengths mismatch
    q_mismatch --> [*]: revert "proposal function information arity mismatch"
    q_validate_actions --> q_create: all validations pass
    q_create --> q_store: proposalId = proposalCount++; startBlock = block.number + votingDelay; endBlock = startBlock + votingPeriod
    q_store --> [*]: store Proposal; emit ProposalCreated; return proposalId

    note right of q_threshold_check
        INV-001: Proposer must have > proposalThreshold votes (e.g., 25000 COMP)
        INV-002: Votes checked at previous block to prevent flash loan attacks
    end note

    note right of q_create
        INV-003: One live proposal per proposer at a time
        INV-004: Max 10 actions per proposal (proposalMaxOperations)
        INV-005: Voting starts after votingDelay blocks (review period)
    end note
